      <Desc>FastPath:FastPath is designed for companies generating $1 million to $5 million in annual revenues. The program is best suited for successful Founder/CEOs, needing up to $1 million in growth capital as well as professional development, including leadership skills, confidence, and vision to overcome challenges and realize opportunities in accelerating revenue growth.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>1357950</ExpenseAmt>
        <GrantAmt>16000</GrantAmt>
        <Desc>Bootcamp:Bootcamp is for entrepreneurs with established businesses, earning a minimum of $250K in annual revenue, who want to achieve rapid growth. 90-day, weekly online 12 group sessions. Onsite Pitch and Graduation Event in La Jolla, CA, with opportunity to compete for up to $7,500 cash and service prizes. Learn what it takes to develop an effective growth and funding plan that gets funders to say yes to your request to fund your business growth. Includes 9-months of post-program support coaching and support.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>740500</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>Passport to Funding A five hour, online, interactive, self-paced certification program designed to educate and guide small business owners through the major hurdles stopping them from obtaining the growth funding they need to fund and grow their business. This program is intended for small and medium businesses generating $50,000 to $10,000,000 in annual revenues.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy3Grp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActyOtherGrp>
        <ExpenseAmt>579150</ExpenseAmt>
        <GrantAmt>9200</GrantAmt>
        <Desc>Challenge:Challenge is for entrepreneurs with established businesses, earning between $50,000 and $250,000 in annual revenue, who want to achieve growth. 60-day Mini-Accelerator Program consists of four (4) workshops where you will learn how to work ON your business, not just IN your business! Program completes with Pitch and Graduation Event, with opportunity to compete for up to $5,000 cash and service prizes. Includes 18 months of post-program support coaching and support.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActyOtherGrp>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActyOtherGrp>
