        <Desc>Clydesdale:Two-month program for 5th grade elementary school students and their families. Students complete language enrichment programs to expose them to concepts/vocabulary about local small business impact in their community, using music. The program is free to participants. Students will participate as youth judges in the regional challenge pitch competition.</Desc>
