        <ExplanationTxt>KIM FOLSOM (BOARD CHAIR) SERVES AS AN OFFICERS OF THE RELATED TAXABLE PARTNERSHIP, FOUNDERS FIRST CAPITAL PARTNERS LLC. A MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING (MOU) FOR THE TRANSACTIONS BETWEEN THESE ENTITIES WAS EXECUTED IN 2024. THE "INTERESTED" BOARD MEMBERS ABSTAINED FROM CONSIDERATION AND APPROVAL OF THE MOU AND ALL SUBSEQUENT TRANSACTIONS. PER THE MOU, THE TWO ENTITIES COLLABORATE IN THE MARKETING AND OFFERING OF TWO ACCELERATOR PROGRAMS DESIGNED TO PROVIDE BUSINESS OWNERS WITH THE SKILLS, TOOLS AND PERSPECTIVES NEEDED TO ACHIEVE LARGE-SCALE GROWTH IN THEIR BUSINESS.</ExplanationTxt>
